  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment Help Guide\n\n### Change Status for Self-Assessment Return\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 23 Jan, 2023 at  5:01 PM\n\nSteps:\n\nThis will help you to change the status from In-Progress to “Submitted” for the returns which you have created in the Capium but submitted from the Third-Party software. Please note you are require to set up and prepare the self assessment before you can update the status.\n\nPlease navigate to the Self-Assessment module\nSelect the client.\n - Click the + SA100 to add a new self assessment and prepare.\nBack In the Client Dashboard, from the Action dropdown, you will have an option “Change Status”\nPlease click “OK” to update the status\nOnce the status has been updated, the status of the return will be shown as “Submitted”\n\nOnce you have updated the Submission status a pop-up box appears |Click ok.\n\nThis will now display the confirmation message as “This return has been submitted through third party.”\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115347\">Self Assessment </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188542\">Self Assessment Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Change Status for Self-Assessment Return\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 23 Jan, 2023 at  5:01 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<div style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/32fac03cd08b47c7a0ef4ea71e69a458\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></div><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: normal; font-size: 15px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: normal; font-size: 15px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong><u><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Steps:</span></u></strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: normal; font-size: 15px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: normal; font-size: 13px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\">This will help you to change the status from In-Progress to “Submitted” for the returns which you have created in the Capium but submitted from the Third-Party software. Please note you are require to set up and prepare the self assessment before you can update the status.</span></span></p><ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\"><li style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Please navigate to the Self-Assessment module</span></span></li><li style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Select the client.</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\"><font>Click the + SA100 to add a new self assessment and prepare.</font></span></span></li><li style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Back In the Client Dashboard, from the Action dropdown, you will have an option “Change Status”</span></span></li><li style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Please click “OK” to update the status</span></span></li><li style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Once the status has been updated, the status of the return will be shown as “Submitted”</span></span></li></ol><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: normal; font-size: 13px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img width=\"624\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9174745968/original/DMwq